Z||000000||TwisT||02-11-2001||02:08 PM||||Well...  I've never posted pictures of my '88 GT because of two reasons:  I couldn't get PIP to work,  and the car is COMPLETELY tore apart now for paint.  I was kinda' waiting for it to be done before I posted pics,  but what the heck.  Here's a few that were taken when I bought it:<P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gt1_1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gt2_2.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gt5.jpg"> <P>I bought it with only 43,000 miles on it...  it is originally a Florida car that spent a lot of it's time in storage.  At the moment,  the car has the cat removed along with Ocelot exhaust,  performance clutch,  Hypertech chip,  2 1/2" shortened shifter,  K&N air filter,  and the air-silencer removed.<P>She is currently tore down for paint,  along with a headlight-motor rebuild and various mods.  Look for lots to happen with this car in the next few months!<P>Brett   <P><BR>||||reg||14
