Z||000006||TwisT||02-11-2001||07:34 PM||||87GT...  Thanks!  <P>The owner of this Fiero lived in Florida,  but had a heck of a time selling it there.  I'm thinking because the car came factory with no A/C.  He brought the car to his parent's place in Moline,  Illinois to try selling.  That's when I found it advertised on the Internet.  And the rest is history!<P>I love this car.  It's my third Fiero,  my first being an '86 GT,  and the second being an '85 GT.  This one,  however,  will be my keeper.<P>  ||||reg||1
