Z||000009||TwisT||02-11-2001||09:12 PM||||Joe,  I'm afraid that picture got the best of you!  It's all computer-done by me.  BUT...  those rocker panels ARE available:<P>Here is the link to the related thread for those cool air intake panels too: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/005701.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/005701.html</A>  <P>Also, here is the link to more pictures of Jerry's products,  including those rocker panels: <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=1315468&a=11483891" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=1315468&a=11483891</A> <P>Hope that helps.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Brett<BR> <P>||||reg||1
Z||000010||TwisT||02-11-2001||09:16 PM||||Sqoach,<P>That wing was a quick attempt at a late-model Saleen Mustang wing.  If you look,  you can see that the wing's profile matches the Fiero's lines nicely.  I've never actually seen one mounted on a fastback GT yet.  Would be neat!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
