Z||000017||TwisT||02-12-2001||09:37 AM||||GTBastard...<P>I was just in Sioux Falls!  Go there every once in a while...  more in the summer.  We will have to get together one of these days.<P>Everyone in Yankton DOES drive nothing but 'Stangs and F-bodies.  Little of everything but Fieros.  There is only two other Fiero GT's in town...  a nice bright blue '87 and another '86/'87 maroon.  Sure don't see them much tho.<P>I'll give you a hollar next time I'm on my way up!<P>Brett||||reg||1
